{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1469989-stv-beneath-shifting-skin-skinchangers-second-editon","id":1469989,"title":"[STV] Beneath Shifting Skin (Skinchangers Second Editon)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-08T19:42:53-08:00","id":1469989,"title":"[STV] Beneath Shifting Skin (Skinchangers Second Editon)","content":"Hey all! Got a new STV book for you:<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/380123/Beneath-Shifting-Skin?affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Beneath Shifting Skin</a></b><br /> <br /> This was Travis Legge's baby, and I was super happy to work with him on it! It's a complete update of the systems in the First Edition supplement <b>Skinchangers</b>. This is kind of an alternate take from the one in <b>Dark Eras</b>, but we really hope you enjoy it! I did the third chapter, so I hope you did all the updated antagonists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 12-09-2021, 04:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-08T19:58:04-08:00","id":1469992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1469989-stv-beneath-shifting-skin-skinchangers-second-editon#post1469989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all! Got a new STV book for you:<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/380123/Beneath-Shifting-Skin?affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Beneath Shifting Skin</a></b><br /> <br /> This was Travis Legge's baby, and I was super happy to work with him on it! It's a complete update of the systems in the First Edition supplement <b>Skinchangers</b>. This is kind of an alternate take from the one on <b>Dark Eras</b>, but we really hope you enjoy it! I did the third chapter, so I hope you did all the updated antagonists.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not gonna lie, i love Skinchangers, some of the stuff from the book had lots of impact in the lore-building of the last Requiem chronicle i ran, back in late 1st ed and hearing of it making an updated comeback of sorts makes me very, very happy and giddy with anticipation indeed. Great news all around.","signatur